# Build output. Regenerated by `npm run build` in app/ — vite wipes and rewrites
# wp-plugin/assets/app/ wholesale (emptyOutDir), so a committed bundle is a
# guaranteed conflict on every branch that touches the front end, and the
# conflict is never resolvable by reading it. Rebuild instead of merging.
# Note: wp-plugin/assets/{portal.js,portal.css,index.html,vite.svg,assets/} are
# NOT build output and stay tracked.
wp-plugin/assets/app/
wp-plugin/staff-portal.zip
